Template: xroad-common/secret-store-node-address
Type: string
Default:
Description: Insert this node's IPv4 address for the OpenBao cluster (leave empty for a single server)
 Leave empty unless this server is a node of a Central Server cluster.
 An empty answer installs OpenBao for a single server, which listens on 127.0.0.1 only.
 .
 With an address, OpenBao also listens on that address, so that the other nodes can reach it.
 The OpenBao TLS certificate names 127.0.0.1, this address and the host name below.

Template: xroad-common/secret-store-node-host
Type: string
Default:
Description: Insert this node's DNS name for the OpenBao cluster (optional)
 Used only together with the node address. When given, the other nodes reach this node's OpenBao by this name,
 and the OpenBao TLS certificate names it.

Template: xroad-common/secret-store-disable-standby-reads
Type: boolean
Default: false
Description: Disable OpenBao standby reads?
 Used only together with the node address. Standby nodes serve reads from the database themselves.
 Disable this when the database uses logical replication, so that no node reads stale secrets.
